# API call for display all questions

###
GET  http://127.0.0.1:8000/questions/
Accept: application/json

# API call for create new question
###
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/questions/
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "title" : "Prime number",
    "language" : "python",
    "difficulty_level" : "",
    "topic" : "",
    "notes" : "This question is about calculating the  given number is prime",
    "sample_input" : "7",
    "sample_output" : "it is prime number",
    "is_active" : true,
    "explanation" : "this is is demo explanation"
}




###
GET  http://127.0.0.1:8000/questions/4/
Accept: application/json 

